{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55293","headline":"偈 · 延禅师","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才到洪山便跥跟，四方八面不言论。\n他家自有眠云志，芦管横吹宇宙喧。\n（《景德传灯录》卷二十、《五灯会元》卷十四。\n）（按：《五灯会元》作「义禅师」，其师作「延禅师」，今从《景德传灯录》及《天圣广灯录》卷二十四目录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延禅师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}